// Dialog - Crate2DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2261908245" "<color orange>The crate has a passcard reader on it. There is also a blinking green light.</color>"
// Page OpenPage1 Text :
"P2085749316" "<color orange>The light turns solid green.</color><br><br>"Ping!""
// Answer Text :
"P71884820" "Open it and grab the brain"
// Page OpenPage2 Text :
"P2146840219" "<color orange>You quickly, but carefully remove the containment cylinder from the liquid nitrogen bath and seal the crate again.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1828441811" "I'm making the next generation of soldier to keep the order in Praetoria.  I call it the Olympian Somethingorother, and you're going to help me complete it.  The last part that I need to get this to work is a cybernetic brain, and I know that Antimatter is working on one right now.  I need you to get that brain for me.  In the meantime, I'll start working on deciphering the mental patterns from this Omega dude so I can add them to the brain you're going to get for me."
// AcceptString :
"P921277474" "Get the cybernetic brain"
// SendOffString :
"P3622698411" "I personally know that Anti-Matter is prototyping this brain at this lab.  Use this passcard, go find the brain and then bring it back to me."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2388114819" "Steal Brain from Anti-Matter's Lab"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2517543589" "With the passcode you can walk in, grab the brain, and leave. It'll be easy."
// TaskTitle :
"P3886335050" "<color deepskyblue>A God Amongst Men</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2273681515" "<color deepskyblue>Part One: A Mind For Detail</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3548917488" "Using this passcard you should be able to get to the brain safely, then get out with no one the wiser."
// ExitStringSuccess :
"P1103485852" "As you leave the facility you hear Anti-Matter's amplified voice booming in rage, 'NEUROOOON!'"

