"P2319749784" "<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color DimGray><bgcolor cyan>Begin by taking the test subject to the target dummies and attacking them.<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color DimGray><bgcolor cyan>Once it recognizes that they are hostile, it will attack as well."
// SaysList :
"P3896302192" "<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color DimGray><bgcolor cyan>That went well, now for the next test...<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color DimGray><bgcolor cyan>Wait... what is the code doing?<t=1 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=1><scale 1.75><color DimGray><bgcolor cyan>!<t=2 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=2><scale 1.75><color DimGray><bgcolor cyan>!!!<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color DimGray><bgcolor cyan> {HeroName}! What did you do to this brain!?<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color DimGray><bgcolor cyan>No no no, I can stop this... one more second...<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color DimGray><bgcolor cyan> {HeroName} it's gone into combat lock.<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color DimGray><bgcolor cyan>You need to shut it down. NOW!"

