// Dialog :
"P4052240576" "Ok, ok, ok, major disaster has been averted, now the political spin doctors are the ones who need to work this all out. I know, the Resitance, yeah, they made some guy who looked like Cole to sow confusion, but you saw through the ruse because you knew Cole wasn't in the city, and then you stopped him. Yeah, that's why you could defeat him. It had nothing to do with me making a clone of the emperor for his army...<br><br>I am so dead."
